  "question": {
    "text": "Match List - I with List - II.\n\\begin{array}{llll} & List - I & & List - II \\\\(A) & Bronze & (I) &\\mathrm{Cu}, \\mathrm{Ni} \\\\(B) & Brass & (II) &\\mathrm{Fe}, \\mathrm{Cr}, \\mathrm{Ni}, \\mathrm{C} \\\\(C) & UK silver coin & (III) &\\mathrm{Cu}, \\mathrm{Zn} \\\\(D) & Stainless steel & (IV) &\\mathrm{Cu}, \\mathrm{Sn}\\end{array}\nChoose the correct answer from the options given below :",
