  "solution": {
    "text": "- Bronze is an alloy of copper and Tin. (A-IV)\n- Brass is an alloy of copper and Zinc. (B-III)\n- UK Silver coin is an alloy of copper and Nickel. (C-I)\n- Stainless steel is an alloy of $\\mathrm{Fe}, \\mathrm{Cr}, \\mathrm{Ni}, \\mathrm{C}$. (D-II)",
